@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About | The Simonton Adventures</PageTitle>

@*
    The About page introduces Steve and Dianne and explains the purpose of
    The Simonton Adventures.

    This page is intentionally simple so it can serve as a visible end-to-end
    deployment test for the AdventuresSuite GitHub Actions and Azure pipeline.
*@

<main class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero">
        <div class="about-content">
            <p class="about-eyebrow">The Simonton Adventures</p>

            <h1>Life is better when we explore it together.</h1>

            <p class="about-lead">
                We are Steve and Dianne Simonton, and some of our favorite
                memories have been made while discovering new places together.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-story">
        <div class="about-content about-reading-width">
            <h2>About Us</h2>

            <p>
                We love traveling, learning the history behind the places we
                visit, taking photographs, sharing great meals, and turning
                those experiences into stories that our family can keep.
            </p>

            <p>
                Every trip gives us another opportunity to laugh, explore,
                learn something new, and create memories together.
            </p>

            <p class="about-highlight">
                Steve would also like the official record to reflect that his
                wife is incredibly hot, and traveling the world with her is
                his favorite adventure.
            </p>

            <p>
                What started as a simple idea to preserve our own memories slowly became
                something much bigger. As we planned our trips, captured photographs,
                organized reservations, wrote stories, and designed our books, we kept
                asking ourselves why there wasn't one place that brought everything
                together.
            </p>

            <p>
                That question eventually inspired a much bigger vision&mdash;to build a
                platform that could help anyone preserve meaningful adventures, not just
                ours. That vision became <strong>AdventuresSuite</strong>, the platform
                powering The Simonton Adventures and, someday, many other creators who
                want to transform their journeys into lasting legacies.
            </p>

            <p>
                The Simonton Adventures is our story. AdventuresSuite is the platform
                that grew from it. Together they represent our belief that every
                meaningful adventure deserves to be remembered, shared, and passed on to
                future generations.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>

<style>
    .about-page {
        min-height: 100vh;
        background:
            linear-gradient(
                180deg,
                rgba(26, 35, 39, 0.88),
                rgba(26, 35, 39, 0.55)
            ),
            url('/images/volumes/volume-1/greece/athens/athens.jpeg')
                center / cover no-repeat fixed;
        color: #f7f4ee;
    }

    .about-hero {
        display: flex;
        align-items: end;
        min-height: 52vh;
        padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem) 1.5rem 4rem;
    }

    .about-story {
        padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem) 1.5rem;
        background: rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.96);
        color: #252525;
    }

    .about-content {
        width: min(100%, 72rem);
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .about-reading-width {
        width: min(100%, 52rem);
    }

    .about-eyebrow {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.16em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
        max-width: 16ch;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
        line-height: 0.98;
    }

    h2 {
        margin-top: 0;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);
    }

    .about-lead {
        max-width: 42rem;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .about-story p {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .about-highlight {
        margin: 2.5rem 0;
        padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
        border-left: 0.3rem solid #9a6e3a;
        background: #ffffff;
        font-size: 1.25rem !important;
        font-style: italic;
    }
</style>